      "stem_html": "<p>Karbókatjónir, sem innihalda þrígilda, jákvætt hlaðna kolefnisfrumeind, hvarfast við vatn og mynda alkóhól:</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcE1RIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--164af3969387dafc125110d7605c49d8750a29d8/OChem_02_EC_023.jpg\" alt=\"A three-carbon chain with a carbocation at C2 reacts with water to form 2-propanol and a hydrogen ion.\">\n<p>Hvernig getur þú útskýrt þá staðreynd að eftirfarandi karbókatjón gefur efnablöndu af <i>tveimur</i> alkóhólum við efnahvarf við vatn?</p>\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBcFFRIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--d24b11d7178826bf3459f7666c360b501ac67456/OChem_02_EC_024.jpg\" alt=\"In a reaction, a carbocation (a carbon cation bonded to a methyl group and an ethene group) reacts with water to form two alcohols.\">\n",
